flowchart LR
	subgraph idp [NestIdP IdP Settings]
		SK[Signing cert + key]
		EK[Encryption cert + key]
	end
	subgraph sp [SP Connection]
		SPB[SP certificate PEM]
		WA[wantAssertionsEncrypted]
	end
	SK -->|XML-DSig| Assert[Signed SAML Assertion]
	EK -->|metadata KeyDescriptor use=encryption| Meta[GET /saml/metadata]
	SPB -->|RSA-OAEP wraps AES key| Assert
	WA -->|AES-256-CBC encrypt| Assert
